remain the property of their author and publisher. Those transcriptions are
deliberately NOT part of this repository (see server/src/db/seeds/orillo.seed.js)
and must not be added to it. Scripture texts, the Roman Missal and the ORDO for
the Dioceses of the Philippines are likewise the property of their respective
copyright holders.

Running this software does not give you permission to reproduce or distribute
any of those texts.
